Thank you!!   It works for the Weather dataset perfectly!!  When i use my data set (please see attached and the following code (your code but I changed the data set from weather to sample):

library(rpart)
library(randomForest)
library(ada)

sample <- read.csv("C:\\temp\\sample.csv")
ds      <- sample
target  <-"WashOutIND"
